      githubApp = service 'GitHub App' {
        description 'CareerBot’s own GitHub App (read-only contents and metadata), created once by the operator through GitHub’s manifest flow: setupLink (Convex CLI) makes a one-time link to a page that sends the manifest to GitHub; GitHub comes back with a code that is exchanged once for the app’s id, private key, client secret and webhook secret, sealed with secretBox. Signs in as the app (RS256, ten minutes) and mints a read-only token per installation for each read; tokens are never stored.'
