    pursue = area 'Pursue' {
      pursuitsApi = service 'Pursuits' {
        description 'Start (one pursuit per role; direction it was opened from, else its best fit; role, company, direction, score and level kept as they were). startAtCompany (Start outreach: a pursuit with no posting, titled with the direction\u2019s name, on the Outreach path; one under way per company and direction; it uses its direction\u2019s resume, takes no tailoring or cover letter, and opens at ?pursuit=). setStatus (stages Preparing, Contacted, Applied, In conversation, Interviewing, Offer, Closed; Closed needs a reason; the first Contacted and Applied dates kept, so a pursuit can be both; reaching Applied, Interviewing or Offer keeps the resume exactly as it shows then, as sent; back to Preparing lets it go), setPath (Apply, Outreach or both; changes only the steps it suggests; its path joins the choice with what was done), setNextStep, setNotes, setResume (which tailored resume it uses; refused once sent or with no open role). saveAnswer (a question and its answer, new or changed; an answer changed loses the facts it rested on), removeAnswer. Leaving Preparing also keeps the newest cover letter and the saved answers as sent. grounding: what writing for a pursuit rests on (approved record, role or that there is no open role, resume as shown or sent, their name). Every change goes on the dated timeline and moves its last activity. get for its page (with the role\u2019s brief; with no open role, its direction\u2019s resume as shown, for the PDF), forPosting for the Role page, list for the Pursuing and Closed views (last activity first, whether a resume is tailored to the role).'
